<title>SRI LANKA: Richard Pieris says 9-mth net up 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Richard Pieris says 9-mth net up 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Richard Pieris &amp; Co Ltd for the nine months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	 1,180.02   vs	 1.083.38</p>
<p>     Net profit	  83.57   vs	    71.29</p>
<p>     Tax provision     13.75   vs	    14.83</p>
<p>NOTE - The blue chip Richard Pieris &amp; Co Ltd is a diversified holding company with interests in manufacturing and distribution of rubber goods, household appliances, agriculture equipment, and estate management.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
